### Problem Type 2: N+1 Query Prevention in Product Listing
**Description:** Fetch products with reviews, ratings, and inventory status efficiently.

**Challenge:** Load 100 products with related data in a single query without fetching each product's reviews individually.

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG: N+1 queries
export const loader = async () => {
  const products = await db.product.findMany({ take: 100 });
  // This triggers 100 additional queries!
  const enriched = await Promise.all(
    products.map(p => 
      db.review.findMany({ where: { product_id: p.id } })
    )
  );
  return json(enriched);
};

// ✅ CORRECT: Single query with eager loading
export const loader = async () => {
  const products = await db.product.findMany({
    take: 100,
    include: {
      reviews: {
        select: { rating: true, comment: true },
      },
      inventory: true,
    },
  });
  return json(products);
};

